silm:instances_papers_10_graph_knowledge_graph_category_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchors#the_substrate_graph_for_the_running_mittens_domain__g_0_cont a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.10_graph_knowledge_graph_category.chapters.01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchors#the_substrate_graph_for_the_running_mittens_domain._g_0_cont" .
silm:instances_papers_10_graph_knowledge_graph_category_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchors#the_substrate_graph_for_the_running_mittens_domain__g_0_cont silm:hasLongDescription "The The substrate graph for the running Mittens domain. G_0 contains the individual cat Mittens, the class DomesticCat, the veterinary record VetRecord77, the body-mass quality BodyMassQuality77, the body-mass measurement BodyMassMeasurement99, the microchip identifier MicrochipIdentifier9, the nap-event NapEvent42, and the taxonomy row \"Felis catus / TSN 183798\". G_1 contains the typed edges rdf:type, is_about, bearer_of, measured_by, participates_in, has_microchip.  is The substrate graph for the running Mittens domain. G_0 contains the individual cat Mittens, the class DomesticCat, the veterinary record VetRecord77, the body-mass quality BodyMassQuality77, the body-mass measurement BodyMassMeasurement99, the microchip identifier MicrochipIdentifier9, the nap-event NapEvent42, and the taxonomy row \"Felis catus / TSN 183798\". G_1 contains the typed edges rdf:type, is_about, bearer_of, measured_by, participates_in, has_microchip." .
silm:instances_papers_10_graph_knowledge_graph_category_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchors#a_is_the_source_object_vetrecord77;_b_is_the_target_object_m a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.10_graph_knowledge_graph_category.chapters.01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchors#a_is_the_source_object_vetrecord77;_b_is_the_target_object_m" .
silm:instances_papers_10_graph_knowledge_graph_category_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchors#a_is_the_source_object_vetrecord77;_b_is_the_target_object_m silm:hasLongDescription "The A is the source object VetRecord77; B is the target object Mittens. The arrow s, t : G_1 -> G_0 reads: the source of the edge (v_record_77_is_about_mittens) is VetRecord77 and the target is Mittens. The reader entering with arbitrary \"A\" sees a concrete record-individual pair.  is A is the source object VetRecord77; B is the target object Mittens. The arrow s, t : G_1 -> G_0 reads: the source of the edge (v_record_77_is_about_mittens) is VetRecord77 and the target is Mittens. The reader entering with arbitrary \"A\" sees a concrete record-individual pair." .
silm:instances_papers_10_graph_knowledge_graph_category_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchors#p_is_the_path_"vetrecord77__[is_about]_>_mittens__[rdf_type] a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.10_graph_knowledge_graph_category.chapters.01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchors#p_is_the_path_\"vetrecord77_-[is_about]->_mittens_-[rdf_type]" .
silm:instances_papers_10_graph_knowledge_graph_category_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchors#p_is_the_path_"vetrecord77__[is_about]_>_mittens__[rdf_type] silm:hasLongDescription "The p is the path \"VetRecord77 -[is_about]-> Mittens -[rdf:type]-> DomesticCat\" (length 2). q is the direct edge \"VetRecord77 -> DomesticCat\" with label class_of_subject (if admitted). The shortcut q is admissible to C_G only as a NAMED composite, i.e. only when the equation q = (rdf:type) o (is_about) is defended.  is p is the path \"VetRecord77 -[is_about]-> Mittens -[rdf:type]-> DomesticCat\" (length 2). q is the direct edge \"VetRecord77 -> DomesticCat\" with label class_of_subject (if admitted). The shortcut q is admissible to C_G only as a NAMED composite, i.e. only when the equation q = (rdf:type) o (is_about) is defended." .
silm:instances_papers_10_graph_knowledge_graph_category_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchors#f_is_the_typed_arrow_rdf_type___mittens__>_domesticcat__g_is a owl:NamedIndividual ;
