silm:instances_papers_10_graph_knowledge_graph_category_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchors#f_is_the_typed_arrow_rdf_type___mittens__>_domesticcat__g_is silm:hasLongDescription "The f is the typed arrow rdf:type : Mittens -> DomesticCat. g is the aboutness arrow is_about : VetRecord77 -> Mittens. The composite g; f is the typed path from VetRecord77 to DomesticCat that the shortcut may abbreviate, subject to a defended equation.  is f is the typed arrow rdf:type : Mittens -> DomesticCat. g is the aboutness arrow is_about : VetRecord77 -> Mittens. The composite g; f is the typed path from VetRecord77 to DomesticCat that the shortcut may abbreviate, subject to a defended equation." .
silm:instances_papers_10_graph_knowledge_graph_category_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchors#the_j_th_source_leg_of_the_mittens_cocone__examples__j=type_ a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.10_graph_knowledge_graph_category.chapters.01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchors#the_j-th_source_leg_of_the_mittens_cocone._examples__j=type_" .
silm:instances_papers_10_graph_knowledge_graph_category_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchors#the_j_th_source_leg_of_the_mittens_cocone__examples__j=type_ silm:hasLongDescription "The The j-th source leg of the Mittens cocone. Examples: j=type yields DomesticCat (with arrow rdf:type); j=evidence yields VetRecord77 (with arrow is_about); j=taxonomy yields the taxonomy row \"Felis catus / TSN 183798\" (with the taxonomy arrow into D_Mittens); j=quality yields BodyMassQuality77 (with bearer_of); j=measurement yields BodyMassMeasurement99 (with measured_by); j=microchip yields MicrochipIdentifier9 (with has_microchip); j=process yields NapEvent42 (with participates_in).  is The j-th source leg of the Mittens cocone. Examples: j=type yields DomesticCat (with arrow rdf:type); j=evidence yields VetRecord77 (with arrow is_about); j=taxonomy yields the taxonomy row \"Felis catus / TSN 183798\" (with the taxonomy arrow into D_Mittens); j=quality yields BodyMassQuality77 (with bearer_of); j=measurement yields BodyMassMeasurement99 (with measured_by); j=microchip yields MicrochipIdentifier9 (with has_microchip); j=process yields NapEvent42 (with participates_in)." .
silm:instances_papers_10_graph_knowledge_graph_category_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchors#y_is_the_concrete_competing_cocone_"vetcareplan22"_—_the_cli a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.10_graph_knowledge_graph_category.chapters.01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchors#y_is_the_concrete_competing_cocone_\"vetcareplan22\"_—_the_cli" .
silm:instances_papers_10_graph_knowledge_graph_category_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchors#y_is_the_concrete_competing_cocone_"vetcareplan22"_—_the_cli silm:hasLongDescription "The Y is the concrete competing cocone \"VetCarePlan22\" — the clinical summary that also receives the head-record and the torso-record legs along compatible arrows. The universal property gives a unique mediator u : Mittens -> VetCarePlan22 that names the clinical summary as a downstream profile target rather than as Mittens itself.  is Y is the concrete competing cocone \"VetCarePlan22\" — the clinical summary that also receives the head-record and the torso-record legs along compatible arrows. The universal property gives a unique mediator u : Mittens -> VetCarePlan22 that names the clinical summary as a downstream profile target rather than as Mittens itself." .
